    },
    {
      "from": "deformation-theory-of-schemes-and-obstruction-spaces",
      "to": "algebraic-spaces-stacks-and-derived-algebraic-geometry-foundations",
      "faithful": false,
      "note": "The five direct citing items were opened. Ordinary-ring domains, cohomological degrees, H0/polynomial cases and the Tor-independent base-change condition are preserved. The exception is lem-lichtenbaum-schlessinger-complex-and-cotangent-ext F2: it attributes the stronger Lichtenbaum–Schlessinger truncation comparison to resolution suppliers that do not state it. Its proof separately cites the exact Stacks theorem; the presentation alert records this limited mismatch."
    }
